#: includes/class-admin.php:516
msgid ""
"Get every form submission on your phone the moment it arrives. Works with "
"Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Elementor Pro, Fluent Forms and "
"Ninja Forms."
msgstr ""
"Recevez chaque formulaire sur votre téléphone dès qu'il arrive. Compatible "
"Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Elementor Pro, Fluent Forms et Ninja"
" Forms."

